<title>USA: J.C. Penney Q3 diluted shr flat at $0.95.</title>
<headline>J.C. Penney Q3 diluted shr flat at $0.95.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.98		    $1.00</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.95		     0.95</p>
<p> Net			236,000		  240,000</p>
<p> Sales		  5,537,000		5,128,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     229,200		  228,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     248,800		  249,000</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.93		    $2.09</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.89		     2.02</p>
<p> Net			471,000		  512,000</p>
<p> Sales		 14,496,000	     13,930,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     228,300		  230,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     248,100		  250,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus earnings estimate for 1996 Q3 was $1.03.</p>
<p>Third quarter diluted earnings of $0.95 per share includes non-recurring expenses of $21 million net of tax, or $0.08 per share.</p>
<p>Full company name is J.C. Penney Co Inc.</p>
